    "facts": "The plaintiff company sued its two former directors for authorising seven payments, totalling S$2,285,000 and US$1,070,000, after their removal as directors. The payees were Kesterion (a BVI company linked to the first defendant), the first defendant personally, and two other parties. The first defendant counterclaimed for salary and housing allowance for his notice period after his employment was terminated.",
