    "significance": "Applies the RDC Concrete categories of repudiatory breach to a redundancy agreement, and holds that a repudiatory breach of an employment contract does not automatically amount to one under a separate redundancy agreement. The court added that an employer can achieve the opposite result with robust drafting.",
